"external"}],"abstract":false,"baseContracts":[],"canonicalName":"ArcNativeCoinShim","contractDependencies":[],"contractKind":"contract","documentation":{"id":24765,"nodeType":"StructuredDocumentation","src":"141:834:32","text":"@notice Fork-test stand-in for Arc's NATIVE-COIN PRECOMPILES, which Foundry's EVM does not implement.\n @dev The Arc USDC proxy (0x3600...) is an ERC-20 *view* over the chain's native coin (18 decimals,\n      balanceOf = nativeBalance / 1e12). Its mint/burn/transfer/totalSupply/blocklist calls are forwarded\n      to precompiles at 0x1800...0000 (authority) and 0x1800...0001 (blocklist). On a Foundry fork those\n      addresses hold the placeholder code 0x01 and every USDC state change reverts with StackUnderflow.\n      This shim is etched ONLY at those two precompile addresses so the REAL USDC / TokenMinterV2 /\n      TokenMessengerV2 / MessageTransmitterV2 bytecode runs unchanged. It does not stand in for any\n      Circle contract. Native-coin accounting is done with vm.deal on real native balances."},"fullyImplemented":true,"linearizedBaseContracts":[24900],"name":"ArcNativeCoinShim","nameLocation":"984:17:32","scope":24913,"usedErrors":[],"usedEvents":[]},{"id":24912,"nodeType":"ContractDefinition","src":"2127:124:32","nodes":[{"id":24911,"nodeType":"FunctionDefinition","src":"2159:90:32","nodes":[],"body":{"id":24910,"nodeType":"Block","src":"2220:29:32","nodes":[],"statements":[{"expression":{"hexValue":"66616c7365","id":24908,"isConstant":false,"isLValue":false,"isPure":true,"kind":"bool","lValueRequested":false,"nodeType":"Literal","src":"2237:5:32","typeDescriptions":{"typeIdentifier":"t_bool","typeString":"bool"},"value":"false"},"functionReturnParameters":24907,"id":24909,"nodeType":"Return","src":"2230:12:32"}]},"functionSelector":"8e204c43","implemented":true,"kind":"function","modifiers":[],"name":"isBlocklisted","nameLocation":"2168:13:32","parameters":{"id":24904,"nodeType":"ParameterList","parameters":[{"constant":false,"